WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.508
"I can find the way home," Tom said.

2
00:00:08.509 --> 00:00:19.538
He sniffed the ground. "Follow me."

3
00:00:19.539 --> 00:00:24.977
Moppet and Mittens followed Tom.

4
00:00:24.978 --> 00:00:35.553
They went back through town.

5
00:00:35.554 --> 00:00:37.885
"Look!" Moppet said.

6
00:00:37.886 --> 00:00:40.507
She stopped at a shop window.

7
00:00:40.508 --> 00:00:44.042
"I see cakes!"

8
00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:52.204
"Mmm!" Tom said. "I see cookies."

9
00:00:52.205 --> 00:00:55.621
The kittens looked in another shop window.

10
00:00:55.622 --> 00:01:08.112
They saw some vegetables.

11
00:01:08.113 --> 00:01:13.626
They smelled fish.

12
00:01:13.627 --> 00:01:16.885
"I'm hungry," Tom said.

13
00:01:16.886 --> 00:01:20.737
"Me too," Moppet said.

14
00:01:20.738 --> 00:01:24.377
"We have to go home," Mittens said.

15
00:01:24.378 --> 00:01:31.062
Then the shop door flew open.

16
00:01:31.063 --> 00:01:33.577
Tom dashed inside.

17
00:01:33.578 --> 00:01:42.019
His sisters ran after him.

18
00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:44.803
The kittens hid under a table.

19
00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:58.923
"Kittens!" the shopkeeper cried.

20
00:01:58.924 --> 00:02:15.113
He got a broom and swept them outside.

21
00:02:15.114 --> 00:02:20.390
Tom saw some trash in an alley.

22
00:02:20.391 --> 00:02:23.332
"Let's look for food," he said.

23
00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:28.145
"Then we can go home."

24
00:02:28.146 --> 00:02:30.211
The kittens found some food.

25
00:02:30.212 --> 00:02:36.006
They started to eat.

26
00:02:36.007 --> 00:02:38.294
Woof! Woof!

27
00:02:38.295 --> 00:02:44.824
"Oh no!" Mittens cried. "Dogs!"

28
00:02:44.825 --> 00:02:51.854
"Grr! Grr!" Two dogs growled at the kittens.

29
00:02:51.855 --> 00:02:56.161
The dogs stepped closer.

30
00:02:56.162 --> 00:03:00.577
The three kittens shook with fear.

